---
title: 'Supported Frameworks'
---

All modules of AG Charts Community and Enterprise are tested to work with the following framework versions.

{% if isFramework("javascript") %}
There are no version compatibility requirements for AG Charts when using the JavaScript version, as long as you are using a [supported browser](./supported-browsers/).

{% /if %}

{% if isFramework("react") %}

| React Version | AG Charts Version |
| ------------- | ----------------- |
| 19            | 11 - 12+          |
| 18            | 9 - 12+           |
| 17            | 9 - 10            |
| 16.8 - 16.14  | 10                |
| 16.3 - 16.7   | 9                 |

{% /if %}

{% if isFramework("angular") %}

| Angular Version | AG Charts Version |
| --------------- | ----------------- |
| 20              | 11.3.2 - 13+      |
| 19              | 11 - 13+          |
| 18              | 10 - 13+          |
| 17              | 10 - 12           |
| 16              | 10                |
| 15              | 9                 |
| 14              | 9                 |

{% /if %}

{% if isFramework("vue") %}

| Vue Version | AG Charts Version |
| ----------- | ----------------- |
| 3.5         | 12+               |
| 3           | 9 - 11            |
| 2           | 9                 |

{% /if %}

{% if isNotJavascriptFramework() %}
It is also possible that AG Charts will work on framework versions outside of what we test on - including past and upcoming versions.
{% /if %}
